- scheduled post-INITIALIZE reset: drain-guarded (never fire while
  low_flash has lazy work queued — a reset landing mid-drain leaves a
  half-written fs and the next boot fails to present the card), then
  rom_reboot with the POWMAN_WDSEL deep bits CLEARED (22/23 post-wipe
  recoveries; deep resets after a wipe came back mute 4/4).
- recovery resets: watchdog_reboot with WDSEL armed at boot — the deep
  SWCORE power-cycle hammered 100/100 on an idle card.
main.c re-arms WDSEL on every boot.
